Computing Fibonacci(20)
========================================

Testing error handling with negative input:
  Correctly returned -1 for negative input

Memoized Fibonacci (O(n) time complexity):
  fib(20) = 6765
  Time: 0.000000208 seconds

Naive Recursive Fibonacci (O(2^n) time complexity):
  fib(20) = 6765
  Time: 0.000019333 seconds

Performance Comparison:
========================================
  Memoized version is 92.9x faster

Theoretical Analysis for n=20:
  Naive: ~2^20 = ~1.05e+06 function calls
  Memoized: 19 unique computations + 19 cache hits

  Results verified: both methods return the same value

